Lanczos Scale — Licensing
==========================

This repository contains two categories of source files with different
licenses. The full text of each license is available in the LICENSES/
directory.

1. Stand-alone Lanczos resampling core
   -------------------------------------
   Files:
     src/lanczos-resample.c
     src/lanczos-resample.h
     tests/test-lanczos-kernel.c
     tests/test-resample.c

   License: Mozilla Public License 2.0 (MPL-2.0)
   See: LICENSES/MPL-2.0

   These files form a self-contained, GIMP-free resampling library.
   They may be used, modified, and redistributed under the terms of
   MPL 2.0. Because MPL 2.0 is compatible with the GNU GPL, these
   files may also be combined with GPL-licensed code.

2. GIMP plug-in and GEGL bridge
   ------------------------------
   Files:
     src/lanczos-scale.c
     src/gimp-io.c
     src/gimp-io.h

   License: GNU General Public License v3.0 or later (GPL-3.0-or-later)
   See: LICENSES/GPL-3.0-or-later

   These files link against libgimp and are therefore licensed under
   GPL v3 (or later) to comply with the GIMP library license. When
   distributed as a compiled plug-in, the combined work is governed by
   GPL v3.

Notice
------

Each source file contains an SPDX-License-Identifier comment that
states its individual license. If you reuse only the stand-alone core
files, you need only comply with MPL 2.0. If you build or distribute
the complete GIMP plug-in, you must comply with GPL v3 for the
combined work.
